    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      438.0,
      309.96,
      496.07
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act as amended by Land Acquisition(Amended) Act No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/servitude which is required fora public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.96,
      510.0,
      282.04,
      520.07
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land/servitude to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      532.85,
      309.96,
      554.92
    ],
    "text": "For the Watappitiya Weekly Fair - to the PradeshiyaSabhawa, Kuruwita",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      556.8,
      310.31,
      626.87
    ],
    "text": "Lot 01 depicted in Plan No. R/325 dated 06.11.2018 preparedby Superintendent of Surveys, Ratnapura situated in thevillage of Pathberiya in Parakaduwa Grama Niladhari Divisionwithin the Divisional Secretariat of Kuruwita, District ofRatnapura, Sabaragamuwa Province. Containing in extent -0.2351 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      329.81,
      561.83,
      397.91
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01Name of the land : Pussellawatta ; Original Owner :Pussallawa Plantation Company Limited, 590, Galle Road,Colombo 03. Land Reform Commission, No. 475, KaduwelaRoad, Battaramulla. Present Claimant: State; Extent: 0.2351Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      411.12,
      562.42,
      513.83
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are herebyrequired to appear personally or by agents duly authorized inwriting before me at Divisional Secretariat, Kuruwita on 11thFebruary, 2019 at 09.00 a.m. and are here by required to notifyme in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 04th February,2019 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars oftheir claims for compensation for the acquisition of the saidland, the amount of compensation, the details of thecomputation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
